  "about": "Choosing the symbol >, < or = between two two-digit numbers, and reading a statement like 37 > 29 as true or false. NC.1.NBT.3 asks him to compare two-digit numbers by tens then ones and to record the result with these three signs.",
  "quiz": true,
  "readChoices": false,
  "tip": "Say \"the open mouth eats the bigger number\", and if both numbers are the same, nobody gets eaten: it is equals.",
